{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Rockabye","artist":"Clean Bandit ft. Anne-Marie","date":"2026-08-18","sourceId":"14756908:006","sourceHash":"49b3777e29f8ea2913bb094ca87b6be4d5b6a9dfcbde2941c92152c934f959f5","duration":254.9,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.476825,"end":8.737,"text":"Call it love and devotion","translation":"사랑과 헌신이라 부르지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":8.777,"end":9.468,"text":"Call it a mom's adoration","translation":"엄마의 지극한 사랑이라 부르지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":9.508571,"end":10.873,"text":"Foundation","translation":"그 토대","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":10.913,"end":12.603,"text":"A special bond of creation,","translation":"창조가 맺어 준 특별한 유대","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":12.643,"end":12.951,"text":"Ha","translation":"하","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":12.991565,"end":16.62,"text":"For all the single moms out there","translation":"세상의 모든 싱글맘들에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":16.66,"end":18.454,"text":"Going through frustration","translation":"좌절을 견뎌 내는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":18.494694,"end":19.418,"text":"Clean Bandit, Sean-da-Paul, Anne-Marie","translation":"클린 밴딧 션 다 폴 앤 마리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":19.458,"end":21.833,"text":"Sing, make them hear","translation":"노래해 모두 듣게 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":21.873,"end":26.036,"text":"She works at nights by the water","translation":"그녀는 물가에서 밤마다 일해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":26.076,"end":29.275,"text":"She's gone astray so far away","translation":"길을 잃고 아주 멀리 떠나왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":29.315,"end":30.657,"text":"From her father's daughter","translation":"아버지의 딸이던 때로부터","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":30.69678,"end":33.989,"text":"She just wants a life for her baby","translation":"그녀는 그저 아이에게 삶을 주고 싶어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":34.028844,"end":36.949,"text":"All on her own, no one will come","translation":"홀로 남아 아무도 오지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":36.989,"end":39.875,"text":"She's got to save him","translation":"그 아이를 지켜야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":39.915,"end":40.548,"text":"Daily struggle","translation":"매일의 고군분투","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":40.588,"end":43.613,"text":"She tells him, \"Ooh, love, no one's ever gonna hurt you, love.","translation":"그녀가 아이에게 말해 내 사랑 누구도 널 다치게 하지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":43.653515,"end":45.936,"text":"I'm gonna give you all of my love.","translation":"내 사랑을 전부 네게 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":45.97551,"end":48.559,"text":"Nobody matters like you...\"","translation":"너만큼 소중한 사람은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":48.599,"end":50.753,"text":"Stay up there, stay up there","translation":"저 위에서 버텨 저 위에서 버텨","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":50.793651,"end":51.659,"text":"She tells him,","translation":"그녀는 아이에게 말해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":51.699,"end":52.82,"text":"\"Your life ain't gon' be nothing like my life.\" (Straight!)","translation":"네 삶은 내 삶과 전혀 다를 거야 정말로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":52.86,"end":54.91,"text":"\"You're gonna grow and have a good life.","translation":"넌 자라서 좋은 삶을 살 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":54.95,"end":58.695,"text":"I'm gonna do what I've got to do.\"","translation":"난 해야 할 일을 할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":58.734875,"end":60.1,"text":"Stay up there, stay up there","translation":"저 위에서 버텨 저 위에서 버텨","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":60.139683,"end":65.301,"text":"So, rockabye baby, rockabye","translation":"그러니 잘 자 아가야 잘 자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":65.340952,"end":65.765,"text":"I'm gonna rock you","translation":"널 재워 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":65.805,"end":68.273,"text":"Rockabye baby, don't you cry","translation":"잘 자 아가야 울지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":68.313,"end":70.467,"text":"Somebody's got you","translation":"누군가 널 돌보고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":70.507,"end":71.814,"text":"Rockabye baby, rockabye","translation":"잘 자 아가야 잘 자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":71.854,"end":75.193,"text":"I'm gonna rock you","translation":"널 재워 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":75.232653,"end":77.085,"text":"Rockabye baby, don't you cry","translation":"잘 자 아가야 울지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":77.125,"end":79.012,"text":"Rockabye, no","translation":"잘 자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":79.052,"end":81.497,"text":"Rockabye-rocka-rocka-rocka-bye","translation":"잘 자 잘 자 잘 자 아가야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":81.536871,"end":83.273,"text":"(Rockabye, yeah, oh, oh)","translation":"잘 자 그래 오 오","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":83.313,"end":84.237,"text":"Rockabye-rocka-rocka-rocka-bye","translation":"잘 자 잘 자 잘 자 아가야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":84.276825,"end":91.481,"text":"Single mom, how're you doing out there?","translation":"싱글맘들 거기서 어떻게 지내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":91.521,"end":93.664,"text":"Facing the hard life without no fear (yeah)","translation":"두려움 없이 고된 삶과 맞서지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":93.704,"end":96.044,"text":"Just so you know that you really care","translation":"네가 진심으로 아낀다는 걸 알아 둬","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":96.084,"end":98.679,"text":"'Cause any obstacle come you're well prepared (oh, no)","translation":"어떤 장애물이 와도 넌 준비돼 있으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":98.719637,"end":100.955,"text":"No, mama, you never shed tear","translation":"아니 엄마 넌 절대 눈물을 흘리지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":100.995,"end":103.126,"text":"'Cause you have to shed things year after year","translation":"해마다 많은 걸 내려놓아야 하니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":103.166,"end":105.309,"text":"And you give the youth love beyond compare (yeah)","translation":"넌 아이에게 견줄 데 없는 사랑을 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":105.348934,"end":108.56,"text":"You find his school fee and the bus fare (yeah)","translation":"학비와 버스비도 마련하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":108.599728,"end":110.324,"text":"Mmm, Marie, the pops' disappear","translation":"음 벌써 아이 아빠는 사라졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":110.364,"end":112.843,"text":"In the wrong bar, can't find him nowhere","translation":"엉뚱한 술집에 있어 어디에서도 찾을 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":112.88381,"end":116.037,"text":"Steadily you work flow, everything you know","translation":"쉬지 않고 일해 힘겨운 걸 알면서도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":116.076553,"end":117.209,"text":"So you nah stop, no time-no time for your jeer","translation":"그래도 멈추지 않아 비웃음에 신경 쓸 틈도 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":117.249,"end":118.985,"text":"Now she got a six-year-old","translation":"이제 그녀에게 여섯 살 아이가 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":119.025,"end":120.773,"text":"Trying to keep him warm","translation":"아이를 따뜻하게 해 주려 애쓰고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":120.813,"end":123.432,"text":"Trying to keep out the cold","translation":"추위를 막아 주려 애써","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":123.472,"end":124.872,"text":"When he looks in her eyes","translation":"아이가 엄마의 눈을 바라볼 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":124.911746,"end":126.068,"text":"He don't know he is safe","translation":"자신이 안전하다는 걸 모른 채","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":126.107574,"end":130.027,"text":"When she says, \"Ooh, love, no one's ever gonna hurt you, love.","translation":"엄마가 말해 내 사랑 누구도 널 다치게 하지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":130.066576,"end":132.383,"text":"I'm gonna give you all of my love.","translation":"내 사랑을 전부 네게 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":132.423,"end":133.091,"text":"Nobody matters like you.\"","translation":"너만큼 소중한 사람은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":133.13161,"end":141.079,"text":"So, rockabye baby, rockabye","translation":"그러니 잘 자 아가야 잘 자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":141.119,"end":141.358,"text":"I'm gonna rock you","translation":"널 재워 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":141.397914,"end":142.821,"text":"Rockabye baby, don't you cry","translation":"잘 자 아가야 울지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":142.860771,"end":144.585,"text":"Somebody's got you","translation":"누군가 널 돌보고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":144.625,"end":146.361,"text